    {"id": "notify_recipient", "operator": "appsdk.collab_send.notify_recipient", "operator_version": "1", "description": "持有当前消息事实的通知 owner。先读取当前逻辑 owner、订阅、current binding、持久 delivery mode 和既有尝试事实，再按通知 policy 判定本次是否可继续。普通 Send 使用默认或明确 immediate 时，virgin original message 可在既有时钟路径续投同一消息；Rex publication gate 忙则在预留 wake attempt、选择 native recipient 和任何 native I/O 前 deferred，返回原 REX_BINDING_PUBLICATION_BUSY 原因及 durable queued 投影，持久 mode 仍为 immediate。窗口未到的 tmux queued 保持 deferred，之后由既有事件窗口编译为内部 daemon-live-closure；Rex queued 在 spawn 前明确不支持；AppServer queued 使用宿主 queued 操作；DSH queued 映射 inject 且不启动 turn；Desktop 保持现有 send 路径，不由此图新增 queued 保证。当前 board invitation 可在无既有尝试或有当前尝试明确未提交证据时由 timer 续投；其他 explicit-notification 保留显式 operator。已撤回、已接受或结果未知的邀请不重发。选择批次时捕获 recipient、selected binding 和 wake attempt，释放状态锁后调用 native transport。返回后提交结果时必须用这些捕获事实重新核对消息当前归属：若消息已交接给新 holder 或其 wake binding 已改变，迟到的 acceptance 或 failure 仍属于原 delivery，不得写入新 holder 的 accepted/evidence/failure，也不得抑制或冒充当前 wake；未改变时才提交本次结果。native acceptance 仍不等于消费。", "inputs": ["committed_batch"], "output": {"id": "notification_receipt", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole"},
    {"id": "emit_send_result", "operator": "appsdk.collab_send.emit_send_result", "operator_version": "1", "inputs": ["notification_receipt"], "output": {"id": "send_result", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole"}
